  "title": "Rustic Chicken Liver and Morel Pate",
  "description": "A rustic French pate baked in a terrine mould (pate en terrine) with chicken livers, ham, and morel mushrooms. Serve with crusty bread, mustard, and pickles.",
  "authors": [
    "stella"
  ],
